sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(via Platform Ingress)
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant API as vLLM OpenAI API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine
    participant Runner as HPUModelRunner
    participant HPU as Intel Gaudi HPU<br/>SynapseAI

    Note over Client,HPU: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>Istio: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS terminated at ingress
    Istio->>API: HTTP/8000<br/>mTLS (mesh)
    API->>Engine: Dispatch request
    Engine->>Runner: Schedule batch<br/>(bucketed)
    Runner->>HPU: Execute model<br/>SynapseAI driver
    HPU-->>Runner: Inference result
    Runner-->>Engine: Output tokens
    Engine-->>API: Streamed/batched response
    API-->>Istio: HTTP response
    Istio-->>Client: Response<br/>(TLS)

    Note over Client,HPU: Flow 2: Model Loading (Startup)

    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>S3/PVC/HF Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    API->>Engine: Initialize model
    Engine->>Storage: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS<br/>Auth: IAM/token
    Storage-->>Engine: Model artifacts
    Engine->>Runner: Load weights
    Runner->>HPU: Transfer to device memory<br/>SynapseAI

    Note over Client,HPU: Flow 3: Distributed KV Cache Transfer (Optional)

    participant PrefillHPU as Prefill Worker HPU
    participant NIXLTransport as NIXL Transport<br/>UCX/RDMA
    participant DecodeHPU as Decode Worker HPU

    PrefillHPU->>NIXLTransport: KV cache pages<br/>RDMA or TCP
    NIXLTransport->>DecodeHPU: KV cache transfer<br/>No encryption documented
